@startuml context
!include _style.iuml
title AllergenTrace – system scope and context

actor "Owner" as Owner
actor "Kitchen staff" as Kitchen
actor "Service staff" as Service
actor "Guest with\nfood allergy" as Guest
actor "Food control\nauthority" as Authority
actor "Supplier" as Supplier

rectangle "AllergenTrace\n(web application)" as System #F0F4EF
rectangle "E-mail service\n(Brevo API, US-20)" as Mail #FFFFFF
rectangle "Open Food Facts API\n(future work, US-21)" as OFF #FFFFFF

Owner --> System : manages staff,\napproves removals,\npublishes menu
Kitchen --> System : enters ingredients,\nrecipes, equipment
Service --> System : looks up dishes\nand explanations
Guest --> System : reads QR menu,\nfilters allergens
System --> Authority : PDF allergen list\n(printed by the owner)
Supplier ..> Kitchen : product labels,\nspecification sheets
System --> Mail : account e-mails,\napproval notices\n(HTTPS)
System ..> OFF : product lookup
@enduml
